    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "gdud",
      "rationale": "Zekarjah inna-yas i ugdud srid: acemi tzeṛẓem tiwsiwin n Yahwe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "עזבתם \/ ויעזב",
      "rationale": "Anqis: tura-agi teǧǧam Yahwe, yuɣal yuǧǧa-kwen — yiwet n tzemrut n tmesliyt, telḥaṣ deg usentel n uḍris."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "ולא תצליחו",
      "rationale": "Kra n isuqalen qquren-t d nnif (ihi ur tettruḥun ara), wayeḍ d asuter (acimi tzeṛẓem... ur tettruḥun ara?)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "רוח לבשה",
      "rationale": "S taɛbranit: ruaḥ tessemsel (telbes) amdan — d tamsetlit, mačči kan d timhelt."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ruaḥ n Elohim telbes ⟨את⟩ Zekarjah, mmi-s n Yehoyada aqohin; yuli d nnig ugdud, yenna-yas: Akka i d-yenna Elohim: Acimi i tzeṛẓem ⟨את⟩ tiwsiwin n Yahwe, ur tettruḥun ara? Axateq teǧǧam Yahwe, yuɣal yuǧǧa-kwen.",
